        "created_at": "2014-06-05T22:14:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><strong>OMNITRON - Recycler Gone Mad - ROUND 7</strong><br><br><strong>Omnitron (39) </strong>[Robot Factory] (Device damage dealt +1)<br>Start of Turn:<br>- Omnitron flips from Robot Factory side (Device Damage +1) to Rampaging Recycler side (Device DR -1)<br><br>Play: <em>Clinging vapors prevent Omnitron from locating the heroes</em><br><br>End of Turn:<br><em>(sound of crickets chirpping in the mist)</em><br><br>========================<br>Effects:<br>- Increase damage dealt by devices by 1 (Omnitron - Robot Factory side)<br>- Reduce damage dealt to devices by 1 (Omnitron - Rampaging Recycler side)<br><br>(Start of Turn)<br>- Flip Omnitron's villain character card (Omnitron - either side)<br><br>(End of Turn)<br>- Shuffle villain trash and reveal cards until a component or drone is revealed.&nbsp; Put it into play (Omnitron - Robot Factory side)<br>- Play the top card of the villain deck (Omnitron - Rampaging Recycler side)<br><br>==========<br><strong>Omnitron (39)</strong> [Rampaging Recycler] (Device DR -1)<br><br>Trash: Adaptive Plating Subroutine, S-85 Repair Drone, Technological Singularity, Sedative Flechettes (x2), Terraforming, Disintegration Ray, Electro-Magnetic Railgun, Electro-Pulse Explosive, S-84 Automaton Drone, S-83 Assault Drone<br><br>==========<br>Golem Unity&nbsp;&nbsp; - 14<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Turret Bot - 4<br>Bunker EOW&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 18 (DR -1)<br>(Sentinels)<br>Doctor Medico - 8<br>The Idealist&nbsp; - 9<br>Mainstay&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 9<br>Writhe&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 9<br>Chrono Ranger - 14<br>DW Nightmist&nbsp; - 15<br>===========<br>Rat Beast - 7<br>&nbsp;</p>",
