        "id": 104195,
        "name": "Humble-Knight",
        "username": "Humble-Knight",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/humble-knight/{size}/2259_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-06-05T23:49:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><span>Golem Unity&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>HP: 14&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>Hand:&nbsp;</span><span>Raptor Bot x2, Flash Forge, Hasty Augmentation, Construction Pylon</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>Play:&nbsp;</span><span>Turret Bot, Swift Bot, Modular Workbench, Supply Crate, Platform Bot</span><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>Trash:&nbsp;</span><span>Robot Reclaimation x2, Construction Pylon, Brainstorm x2, Inspired Repair, Powered Shockwave, Scrap Metal x2, Hasty Augmentation</span><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>Effects:&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>--------------------------------------------------------------------------&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>Start: Turret Bot shoots Omnitron [36] </span></p><p><span>Destroy Supply Crate and Draw Champion bot and Platform Bot</span></p><p><span>Play: Hasty Augmentation, Chrono Ranger may use a power (+2 to its damage) &nbsp;</span></p><p><span>Play: Construction Pylon</span></p><p><span>Power: Construction Pylon, Play Raptor Bot x2, Destroy Construction Pylon &nbsp;</span></p><p><span>Draw: Brainstorm and Construction Pylon&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>End: Platform Bot shoots Omnitron for 3 energy damage [I assume it will be 27 because CR shoots it for 6] </span></p><p><span>Raptor Bot 1 eats Omnitron for 6 melee damage [21]</span></p><p><span>Raptor Bot 2 snacks on Omnitron for another 6 melee damage [15]</span></p><p><span>--------------------------------------------------------------------------&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>HP: 14 </span></p><p><span>Hand: &nbsp;Flash Forge, Champion Bot, Platform Bot, Brainstorm, Construction Pylon &nbsp;</span></p><p><span>Play: Turret Bot, Swift Bot, Modular Workbench, Platform Bot, Raptor Bot, Raptor Bot&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>Trash:&nbsp;Robot Reclaimation x2, Construction Pylon x2, Brainstorm x2, Inspired Repair, Powered Shockwave, Scrap Metal x2, Hasty Augmentation x2&nbsp;</span></p><p><span>Effects: Platform Bot has DR 1</span></p><p><span>Turret Bot: 4, Swift Bot: 6, Plattform Bot: 3, Raptor Bot 1: 2,&nbsp;</span><span>Raptor Bot 2: 2</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>So that was fun. I think we will come very, very close to killing him, if we don't do it all the way. Unless some thing awful comes out of the environment deck, I will have enough damage to kill him next turn</span></p>",
