        "created_at": "2014-06-06T05:08:31.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think we've got him this round...between the Sentinels, CR's Hunter and Hunted/Compound Bow, and that Oblivion, we should be good to go.</p><p><strong>Bunker: Engine of WAR!</strong></p><p><strong>HP:</strong>&nbsp;18<br><strong>Hand:</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;Decommissioned Hardware, Auxiliary Power Source (x2); Omni-Cannon<br><strong>Play:</strong>&nbsp; Heavy Plating, Grenade Launcher; Maintenance Unit<br><strong>Trash:</strong>&nbsp;Turret Mode; Ammo Drop; Adhesive Foam Grenade (x2)<br><strong>Effects:&nbsp;</strong>Damage dealt to Bunker: EOW is at -1</p><p>-----------------------------------------------------</p><p><strong>Start:</strong><br><strong>Play: &nbsp;</strong>Auxiliary Power Source<br><strong>Power:</strong>&nbsp;Grenade Launcher--deals net 2 projectile damage to Omnitron (13), net 2 damage to Rat-Beast (5). &nbsp;No third target.<br><strong>Draw:</strong>&nbsp; Maintenance Unit<br><strong>End:</strong></p><p>-----------------------------------------------------</p><p><strong>HP:</strong>&nbsp;18<br><strong>Hand:</strong>&nbsp; Decommissioned Hardware; &nbsp;Auxiliary Power Source; Omni-Cannon; Maintenance Unit<br><strong>Play:</strong>&nbsp;Heavy Plating,Grenade Launcher; Maintenance Unit; Auxiliary Power Source<br><strong>Trash:</strong>&nbsp;Turret Mode; Ammo Drop; Adhesive Foam Grenade (x2)</p><p><strong>Effects:&nbsp;</strong>All damage dealt to Bunker: EOW is at -1</p>",
