        "created_at": "2014-06-06T05:38:54.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p><strong>The Sentinels</strong></p><p><strong>HP: </strong>Medico [8], Idealist [9], Mainstay [9], Writhe [9]<br><strong>Hand:</strong> Fling Into Darkness, Positive Energy, Second Chance, Durasteel Chains<br><strong>Play: </strong>Aura of Vision<br><strong>Trash:</strong> Coordinated Assault, Good Hero - Bad Hero, Horrifying Dichotomy, Sentinel Tactics, Hippocratic Oath<br><strong>Effects:</strong> One player may draw a card if Idealist is active at the start of the turn</p><p>--------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p><strong>Start:</strong> Draw Telekinetic Wallop from Aura of Vision<br><strong>Play:</strong> Telekinetic Wallop - Idealist deals 3 psychic damage to Omnitron [10] and the Rat-Beast [2]<br><strong>Power:</strong> Telekinetic Jab - Idealist deals 2 psychic damage to Omnitron [8]<br><strong>Draw:</strong> Unique Capabilities<br><strong>End:</strong></p><p>--------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p><strong>HP: </strong>Medico [8], Idealist [9], Mainstay [9], Writhe [9]<br><strong>Hand:</strong> Fling Into Darkness, Positive Energy, Second Chance, Unique Capabilities, Durasteel Chains<br><strong>Play: </strong>Aura of Vision<br><strong>Trash:</strong> Coordinated Assault, Good Hero - Bad Hero, Horrifying Dichotomy, Sentinel Tactics, Hippocratic Oath, Telekinetic Wallop<br><strong>Effects:</strong> One player may draw a card if Idealist is active at the start of the turn</p>",
